      {
        "id": 230890,
        "name": "Escher",
        "username": "Escher",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/escher/{size}/4865_2.png",
        "created_at": "2020-06-03T18:15:00.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>As far as the Scions go, they're all dead (pending revival or retconning) except for Dark Mind (escaped), Voss (depowered and incarcerated, which can't possibly go wrong in any way), and <em>possibly</em>&nbsp;Empyreon.&nbsp; Empyreon&nbsp;was in the middle of&nbsp;a massive explosion that put Captain Cosmic in&nbsp;a coma, but we never saw a body (does&nbsp;Empyreon the living black hole even have one?), so his fate is uncertain.&nbsp; After all, Captain Cosmic survived it, barely.</p>\n<p>Of the others:</p>\n<p>Borr blowed up real good and is confirmed dead-dead by C&amp;A in this episode. Nixious was blasted by Voss to conceal his treachery and also confirmed dead in this episode.&nbsp;Progeny took a time-bullet to the head and was destroyed by the newly-revived Chrono Ranger's time-pistol. Voidsoul ate the shadow cloak and&nbsp;temporarily escaped to space, only to be literally torn apart by the newly-empowered and focused Guise. Aeon Master got consumed by Lifeline and the energy reformed into Aeon Girl, who is more of a person than AM ever was (but in theory there could be some elements of AM's personality still reverberating in AG's mind).&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Faultless spent the last of his energy to pull Dark Mind into his body, giving her a physical form that empowered her but made her vulnerable.&nbsp; Since she escaped with that body, some part of Faultless still exists, though it seems unlikely for him to return.</p>\n<p>Sanction got mind-wiped by Omnitron and Parse's team-up hacking attack, so as far as we know, she's dead.&nbsp; But that does mean both of them were exposed to Sanction's code-base and the physical body is presumably still around somewhere, so there's at least a potential path to come back.</p>",
        "post_number": 2,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T06:06:00.409Z",
        "reply_count": 0,
        "reply_to_post_number": null,
        "quote_count": 0,
        "incoming_link_count": 0,
