        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/l/f4b2a3/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2025-11-24T12:51:28.663Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Sheep of a leather flock together.</p>\n<p>They very quickly Rolodex and abandon a ton of cool ideas in this episode.</p>\n<p>I wonder how Idolater finds his Scarred Congregation.  I find it funny to imagine him placing an ad in the newspaper like an injury lawyer.  “Have you suffered loss at the hands of an angry Latina with wings? You may be entitled to compensation!”</p>\n<p>App developer, to Guise: “Why are you paying my $10,000 contract with five thousand $20 bills?”</p>\n<p>Mattyland, home of the Mattylandians.</p>\n<p>But can you explain your code to Leonard Lecluck?</p>\n<p>It’d be interesting to tell a story about Omnitron 8 or 9 being friendly or cooperative to literally any nonhuman character.</p>",
        "post_number": 5,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2025-11-24T13:40:28.070Z",
        "reply_count": 0,
        "reply_to_post_number": null,
